<h2>Fokly 1.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Fokly now updates itself.</b> It checks once a day and never interrupts a focus session: a small Update button appears in the popover instead. You can turn the check off in Settings → About.</li>
  <li>A new install window.</li>
  <li>Settings → About shows the right version number.</li>
</ul>
